WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.000
The light starter cancels into the OD Tatsu route.

2
00:00:04.000 --> 00:00:05.000
Heavy Shoryuken finishes the first juggle.

3
00:00:05.000 --> 00:00:05.500
